{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109210/extras/77c1a387f2cb64f9015d798eca72dbf0.poster.avif?t=1774816187\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109210/extras/77c1a387f2cb64f9015d798eca72dbf0.webm?t=1774816187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109210/extras/77c1a387f2cb64f9015d798eca72dbf0.mp4?t=1774816187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter an ASCII bullet hell and carve your way towards humanity's most feared weapons... and take them down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your enemies are many, so you will die. A lot. But metal is cheap, and parts can be swapped. So you can keep trying as much as you need. It is not <i>you</i> catching the bullets anyway.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >C424 &quot;Cara&quot; - Gen 4 Combat Android</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your weapon. Your arms and legs. The instrument to enact your will. She is yours to command and yours to do with as you see fit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or your trusted partner, your missing half, and maybe, even your friend. It all depends entirely on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run will leave its mark on her body. Take care of her well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109210/extras/a381c51a956582795ad22f2d011ef0ff.poster.avif?t=1774816187\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109210/extras/a381c51a956582795ad22f2d011ef0ff.webm?t=1774816187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109210/extras/a381c51a956582795ad22f2d011ef0ff.mp4?t=1774816187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep, Multi-Layered Lore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>Strata 13</strong> and discover the origins and horrors of the Human-Android conflict that spans millennia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about the fractured humanity, shattered and spread through the hundreds of Strata which encompass the Megastructure and the vicious Androids, organized into an ultimate extermination force, trying to hunt humanity down to extinction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight, Unlock, Upgrade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies and use the data and upgrades you collect to turn C424 into a weapon that fits your playstyle. If only fate would be so kind as to give you what you need. But the Admin must make do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109210/extras/89feb20c8a86d84ad5c3bbc97008b4f7.poster.avif?t=1774816187\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109210/extras/89feb20c8a86d84ad5c3bbc97008b4f7.webm?t=1774816187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109210/extras/89feb20c8a86d84ad5c3bbc97008b4f7.mp4?t=1774816187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which enemy will you face first? Who will you aid and who will you destroy? Everything matters. Your mistakes add up, and forgiveness is hard to come by.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4109210?t=1774816187","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4109210?t=1774816187","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109210/b67aff51ea338df0ba0b027968d32bbdfb5502a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774816187","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109210/b67aff51ea338df0ba0b027968d32bbdfb5502a6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774816187","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game might contain themes and depictions that some people might fight disturbing or unsettling. Such themes include suicide, mental illness, mild gore and body horror."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109210/extras/77c1a387f2cb64f9015d798eca72dbf0.poster.avif?t=1774816187\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109210/extras/77c1a387f2cb64f9015d798eca72dbf0.webm?t=1774816187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109210/extras/77c1a387f2cb64f9015d798eca72dbf0.mp4?t=1774816187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter an ASCII bullet hell and carve your way towards humanity's most feared weapons... and take them down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your enemies are many, so you will die. A lot. But metal is cheap, and parts can be swapped. So you can keep trying as much as you need. It is not <i>you</i> catching the bullets anyway.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >C424 &quot;Cara&quot; - Gen 4 Combat Android</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your weapon. Your arms and legs. The instrument to enact your will. She is yours to command and yours to do with as you see fit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or your trusted partner, your missing half, and maybe, even your friend. It all depends entirely on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run will leave its mark on her body. Take care of her well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109210/extras/a381c51a956582795ad22f2d011ef0ff.poster.avif?t=1774816187\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109210/extras/a381c51a956582795ad22f2d011ef0ff.webm?t=1774816187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109210/extras/a381c51a956582795ad22f2d011ef0ff.mp4?t=1774816187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep, Multi-Layered Lore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>Strata 13</strong> and discover the origins and horrors of the Human-Android conflict that spans millennia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about the fractured humanity, shattered and spread through the hundreds of Strata which encompass the Megastructure and the vicious Androids, organized into an ultimate extermination force, trying to hunt humanity down to extinction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight, Unlock, Upgrade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies and use the data and upgrades you collect to turn C424 into a weapon that fits your playstyle. If only fate would be so kind as to give you what you need. But the Admin must make do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109210/extras/89feb20c8a86d84ad5c3bbc97008b4f7.poster.avif?t=1774816187\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109210/extras/89feb20c8a86d84ad5c3bbc97008b4f7.webm?t=1774816187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109210/extras/89feb20c8a86d84ad5c3bbc97008b4f7.mp4?t=1774816187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which enemy will you face first? Who will you aid and who will you destroy? Everything matters. Your mistakes add up, and forgiveness is hard to come by.\u00a0</p>","developers":["SIS STYLE INTERACTIVE"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109210/8017bd66d2546aef259ccdc47d26722f1fc981eb/header.jpg?t=1774816187","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4109210/1279961099/ef98355ce09dcb509fc9552555506e5541c4076a/1774650145/dash_av1.mpd?t=1774798991","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4109210/1279961099/ef98355ce09dcb509fc9552555506e5541c4076a/1774650145/dash_h264.mpd?t=1774798991","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4109210/1279961099/ef98355ce09dcb509fc9552555506e5541c4076a/1774650145/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=177479