74121d0bf7a86/ss_f335a383606b845be4d316013db74121d0bf7a86.600x338.jpg?t=1774816187"}],"short_description":"Humanity must be eradicated! Thus spoke the ADMIN. And his Android obeys... for now. Enact your revenge upon those who forsook you. Upgrade C424, keep her loyal and use her to paint the Concrete Plains red. But remember: PANOPTICON lies.","steam_appid":4109210,"support_info":{"email":"sisstyle@icloud.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"http://sebastiandokia.com/blood-in-the-panopticon"}